---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---

<Layout
  title={`About Us | ${site.name}`}
  description="Learn about LandSlide Trading and Contracting, our core values, mission, landmark achievements, and commitment to shaping Qatar's future."
>
  <!-- Page Hero Header -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="hero-tag">Company Profile</span>
      <h1 class="page-hero-title">A Pillar of Excellence in Qatar's Construction Industry</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-desc">
        Delivering excellence across residential, commercial, and industrial sectors with an uncompromising commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content & Narrative -->
  <section class="py-section bg-white">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <div class="about-lead-block">
        <div class="logo-box">
          <img src="/logo.png" alt="LandSlide Trading and Contracting" class="about-logo" />
        </div>
        <p class="lead-paragraph">
          <strong>LandSlide Trading and Contracting Company</strong>, based in Doha, Qatar, has established itself as a premier player in the construction industry, known for its commitment to quality, innovation, and sustainability. With a diverse portfolio of projects and a dedicated team of professionals, LandSlide has made significant contributions to Qatar’s rapidly evolving urban landscape.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="article-section">
        <h2>Company Overview</h2>
        <p>
          LandSlide Trading and Contracting Company was founded with a vision to deliver excellence in every project, big or small. The company's philosophy revolves around a client-centric approach, ensuring that each project meets the highest standards of quality and safety. With a robust portfolio that spans residential, commercial, and industrial sectors, LandSlide has become synonymous with reliability and professionalism.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">⚖️</div>
          <h3>Integrity</h3>
          <p>Transparent, ethical business conduct with our clients, engineering partners, and regulatory authorities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">🏆</div>
          <h3>Quality</h3>
          <p>Rigorous craftsmanship standards, durable materials, and zero-defect execution from foundation to handover.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card">
          <div class="value-icon">💡</div>
          <h3>Innovation</h3>
          <p>Modern Building Information Modeling (BIM), state-of-the-art methodology, and smart project management.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="article-section">
        <h2>Core Values and Mission</h2>
        <p>
          At the heart of LandSlide’s operations are its core values: integrity, quality, and innovation. The company is committed to maintaining transparent and ethical business practices, building strong relationships with clients, partners, and suppliers. LandSlide’s mission is to be a leader in the construction industry, delivering projects that enhance the built environment and contribute to the economic growth of Qatar.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Key Flagship Achievements -->
      <div class="article-section">
        <h2>Key Projects and Achievements</h2>
        <p>Our footprint is etched across some of the most prestigious capital developments in the State of Qatar:</p>

        <div class="achievements-list">
          <div class="achievement-item">
            <span class="achieve-num">1</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Msheireb Downtown Doha</h4>
              <p>One of LandSlide’s flagship projects, the Msheireb Downtown Doha, is a model of sustainable urban development. LandSlide contributed to the construction of this smart city district, focusing on sustainable building practices, advanced technology integration, and preserving the cultural heritage of Doha.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="achievement-item">
            <span class="achieve-num">2</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Lusail City Development</h4>
              <p>As part of Qatar’s visionary Lusail City project, LandSlide played a pivotal role in constructing infrastructure that supports this futuristic metropolis. The company’s involvement included building state-of-the-art residential complexes, commercial towers, and recreational facilities.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="achievement-item">
            <span class="achieve-num">3</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Salwa Beach Resort</h4>
              <p>LandSlide's expertise in luxury hospitality projects is exemplified in its work on the Salwa Beach Resort. The company was instrumental in constructing the resort’s high-end villas, sprawling pool areas, and exquisite landscaping, ensuring the resort met international standards of luxury and comfort.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="achievement-item">
            <span class="achieve-num">4</span>
            <div>
              <h4>Qatar Rail & Doha Metro</h4>
              <p>Contributing to the development of Qatar’s transportation network, LandSlide has been involved in constructing sections of the Qatar Rail project, providing efficient and sustainable public transport options for residents and visitors alike.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="article-section">
        <h2>Commitment to Sustainability</h2>
        <p>
          LandSlide Trading and Contracting Company places a strong emphasis on sustainability, aligning with Qatar’s National Vision 2030 for sustainable development. The company adopts green building practices, uses eco-friendly materials, and implements energy-efficient technologies in its projects. By focusing on sustainability, LandSlide not only contributes to environmental preservation but also ensures long-term value for its clients.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="article-section">
        <h2>Technological Innovation</h2>
        <p>
          Innovation is a cornerstone of LandSlide’s approach to construction. The company leverages the latest technologies in project management, design, and construction to enhance efficiency and precision. From using Building Information Modeling (BIM) for accurate project planning to implementing advanced construction techniques, LandSlide stays ahead of industry trends.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="article-section">
        <h2>Safety and Quality Assurance</h2>
        <p>
          Safety is paramount in LandSlide’s operations. The company adheres to stringent safety protocols and standards to ensure a safe working environment for its employees and contractors. Quality assurance is also a key focus, with comprehensive quality control measures in place to guarantee that every project meets the highest standards of craftsmanship.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="article-section">
        <h2>Workforce and Culture</h2>
        <p>
          LandSlide’s success is driven by its talented and diverse workforce. The company invests in training and development, ensuring that its employees are equipped with the latest skills and knowledge. The culture at LandSlide is one of collaboration, respect, and continuous improvement, fostering an environment where innovation thrives.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="article-section">
        <h2>Community Engagement</h2>
        <p>
          LandSlide Trading and Contracting Company is committed to giving back to the community. The company engages in various corporate social responsibility (CSR) initiatives, supporting local charities, educational programs, and environmental conservation efforts. LandSlide believes in making a positive impact not only through its projects but also through its actions in the community.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="conclusion-box">
        <h3>Building a Better Future, One Project at a Time</h3>
        <p>
          LandSlide Trading and Contracting Company stands as a pillar of excellence in Qatar’s construction industry. With a focus on quality, innovation, and sustainability, LandSlide continues to shape the future of urban development in Qatar. The company’s commitment to delivering exceptional projects while upholding the highest standards of safety and integrity ensures its place as a trusted partner in Qatar’s growth and development.
        </p>
        <div style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Connect With Our Team</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #07192e 0%, #0d2847 60%, #164273 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    padding: 5rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    background: rgba(217, 147, 27, 0.15);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .page-hero-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.25;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero-title {
      font-size: 3.25rem;
    }
  }

  .page-hero-desc {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-lead-block {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .logo-box {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-logo {
    height: 60px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .lead-paragraph {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .article-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .article-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .article-section h2::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .article-section p {
    color: var(--text-main);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 3.5rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .values-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .value-card {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 1.75rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .value-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    border-color: rgba(217, 147, 27, 0.4);
  }

  .value-icon {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .value-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .value-card p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .achievements-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .achievement-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .achieve-num {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .achievement-item h4 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .achievement-item p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .conclusion-box {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d2847 0%, #164273 100%);
    color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 2.5rem;
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
  }

  .conclusion-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .conclusion-box p {
    color: #e2e8f0;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
</style>
